{
  "name": "WF1 - Crawl My Drive lessons",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "availableInMCP": false
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wf1-sticky",
      "name": "Import notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        -360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF1 \u2014 crawl My Drive, call WF2\n\nImport **after WF2**. Leave **inactive** until a test run is green.\n\n1. Credential = **EF Google Drive** (`info@evergladesliteracy.org`).\n2. Open **Call WF2** \u2192 Workflow **From list** \u2192 **WF2 - Process one Drive lesson file** (JSON still has a placeholder ID).\n3. First test: keep **Limit = 25**. After `SELECT COUNT(*) FROM lessons;` looks right, enable **Return All** on List My Drive files.\n\nSearch uses Advanced Search `trashed = false and 'me' in owners` with **no Folder filter**, so nested My Drive files are included. Then keep PDFs and Docs only. Loop Over Items calls WF2 once per file.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-trigger",
      "name": "When clicking Test workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-search",
      "name": "List My Drive files",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "fileFolder",
        "operation": "search",
        "searchMethod": "query",
        "queryString": "trashed = false and 'me' in owners",
        "returnAll": false,
        "limit": 25,
        "filter": {
          "whatToSearch": "files"
        },
        "options": {
          "fields": [
            "id",
            "name",
            "mimeType",
            "webViewLink",
            "*"
          ]
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "EF Google Drive"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-filter",
      "name": "Keep PDFs and Docs",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        500,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nreturn items.filter(({ json }) => {\n  const mime = String(json.mimeType || '').toLowerCase();\n  const name = String(json.name || '').toLowerCase();\n  if (mime.includes('folder') || mime.includes('shortcut')) return false;\n  return (\n    mime.includes('pdf') ||\n    mime.includes('document') ||\n    mime.includes('msword') ||\n    mime.includes('wordprocessingml') ||\n    name.endsWith('.pdf') ||\n    name.endsWith('.doc') ||\n    name.endsWith('.docx')\n  );\n});\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-loop",
      "name": "Loop Over Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        760,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-execute",
      "name": "Call WF2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_WF2_ID"
        },
        "mode": "once",
        "options": {}
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "wf1-done",
      "name": "Crawl finished",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1020,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When clicking Test workflow": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "List My Drive files",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "List My Drive files": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep PDFs and Docs",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep PDFs and Docs": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Items",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Loop Over Items": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Crawl finished",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "node": "Call WF2",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Call WF2": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Loop Over Items",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
